ory-gate.py --story CAT-04 --stage test` again.\n2. Or allow this session to run `~/.dotnet/dotnet`, and I'll rerun the gate from here.\n\nThe existing `tests.md` and the seven break patches can stay as they are. Nothing in the report asks for a change to them.","ttft_ms":2542,"type":"result","duration_ms":30285,"uuid":"e68af56a-9e19-460d-8b45-2121846b93d6","ttft_stream_ms":1899,"time_to_request_ms":31,"first_content_frame_ms":1900,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
